    <item>
      <title>Text Categorization Using Encoder only Transformer</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/project/text-classification/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/text-classification/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;institution&#34;&gt;Institution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;National University of Sciences and Technology, Islamabad, Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Dec 2023 - Jan 2024&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-description&#34;&gt;Project Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal here was to sort text into a fixed set of categories automatically. I used an encoder-only transformer, the same family as BERT, because it builds a representation of the whole input, which suits classification well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-highlights&#34;&gt;Project Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
