    <item>
      <title>Multiclass Image Classification using Transfer Learning</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/project/image-classification/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/image-classification/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-description&#34;&gt;Project Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I built a multiclass image classifier on top of InceptionResNetV2. Rather than training a large network from scratch, I started from a pre-trained model and reused what it had already learned, then trained it to recognize my own set of classes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-highlights&#34;&gt;Project Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used InceptionResNetV2 as the base model and adapted it to the target classes through transfer learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added data augmentation and input normalization so the model would do better on images it had not seen during training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wrote the full training and evaluation pipeline in Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;technical-skills-acquired&#34;&gt;Technical Skills Acquired&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transfer Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer Vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Augmentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Adaptive Irrigated Agriculture Monitoring (Embedded &#43; Cloud)</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/project/irrigation-monitoring/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jan 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/irrigation-monitoring/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-description&#34;&gt;Project Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was an IoT system for keeping track of conditions in the field. Embedded sensor nodes measured soil and air conditions and sent the readings to the cloud in real time, so irrigation could follow what the crop actually needed instead of a fixed schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-highlights&#34;&gt;Project Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built the embedded sensor setup that reads soil and air conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connected the sensor nodes to the cloud for real-time monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used the incoming data to decide when and how much to irrigate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;technical-skills-acquired&#34;&gt;Technical Skills Acquired&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IoT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
